// Bitcoin Script Example: Bitwise Operations
// Demonstrates bitwise logic opcodes

// AND operation
// Binary: 1100 (12) & 1010 (10) = 1000 (8)
12 10 and
// Stack: [8]

// OR operation
// Binary: 1100 (12) | 1010 (10) = 1110 (14)
12 10 or
// Stack: [8, 14]

// XOR operation
// Binary: 1100 (12) ^ 1010 (10) = 0110 (6)
12 10 xor
// Stack: [8, 14, 6]

// Left shift
// Binary: 101 (5) << 2 = 10100 (20)
5 2 lShift
// Stack: [8, 14, 6, 20]

// Right shift
// Binary: 10100 (20) >> 2 = 101 (5)
20 2 rShift
// Stack: [8, 14, 6, 20, 5]

// Invert (bitwise NOT)
// ~5 = -6 (two's complement in 32-bit)
5 invert
// Stack: [8, 14, 6, 20, 5, -6]
